WEBVTT

01:59.035 --> 02:00.411
You're so warm.

02:08.545 --> 02:09.712
I'm hungry.

02:41.995 --> 02:44.622
BATES MOTEL
PARKING LOT

02:55.800 --> 02:56.634
Nice move.

02:56.926 --> 02:59.929
- You're cold, so go inside and warm up.
- Okay, let's do that.

03:00.346 --> 03:01.181
By yourself.

03:15.778 --> 03:16.821
Hello.

03:18.406 --> 03:19.282
My gosh.

03:20.158 --> 03:22.952
You're both soaked.

03:23.745 --> 03:25.914
For one night or just for a few hours?

03:29.209 --> 03:30.793
- Well--
- Which room do you want?

03:30.877 --> 03:32.837
The mirror room? The themed room?

03:32.921 --> 03:33.922
- Or costumes?
- No.

03:34.964 --> 03:35.798
Well...

03:38.259 --> 03:39.260
Come here.

03:40.720 --> 03:41.930
Come here. Come on.

03:44.015 --> 03:45.475
- Do you want any add-ons?
- Sorry?

03:45.767 --> 03:47.560
A love chair? A vibrating bed?

03:48.478 --> 03:50.188
How about handcuffs or a whip?

03:51.439 --> 03:53.816
I'll give you ten percent off
if you pay cash.

03:55.109 --> 03:56.110
Let's go.

03:56.194 --> 03:58.363
How about a whirlpool tub?
Don't tell anyone--

03:58.446 --> 03:59.781
- Come on. Let's go.
- No.

03:59.864 --> 04:01.032
I like this place.

04:03.243 --> 04:04.661
Come on. I'll take you home.

04:04.744 --> 04:07.872
- I don't want to freeze to death.
- Our rooms are steamy hot.

04:10.083 --> 04:12.377
- Do you live far from here?
- That's not the point.

04:12.460 --> 04:15.129
Why bring your motorcycle
in this torrential rain?

04:15.838 --> 04:18.675
- Then just take a taxi home.
- Give me money for the ride.

04:19.717 --> 04:21.261
Hey, don't tell me--

04:21.344 --> 04:24.389
Right. I didn't bring anything.
Not even my wallet and phone.

04:25.014 --> 04:26.307
Then if I hadn't come--

04:26.391 --> 04:29.435
I would've walked all night in the rain,
like a crazy woman.

04:30.186 --> 04:33.773
Can you please think before you act?
Don't be so impulsive and reckless.

04:34.941 --> 04:37.110
Anything can happen
on that dark, remote road.

04:37.193 --> 04:39.988
How could you keep walking
all by yourself? You're fearless.

04:41.072 --> 04:42.615
If something bad happened...

04:48.037 --> 04:49.038
Why are you mad?

04:49.455 --> 04:51.291
Who cares if I walk all night

04:51.374 --> 04:53.126
or put on a strip show in the rain?

04:53.876 --> 04:54.961
Why are you upset?

04:56.671 --> 04:58.214
Were you worried about me?

04:59.465 --> 05:00.675
Are you upset?

05:02.552 --> 05:03.845
Does your heart ache?

05:09.934 --> 05:10.768
Do you...

05:12.812 --> 05:13.896
like me?

05:18.985 --> 05:22.363
Well, I'm asking
because I really have no clue.

05:22.905 --> 05:23.865
You know that.

05:23.948 --> 05:27.201
You'd better not act like you know
and understand everything about me

05:27.493 --> 05:29.662
when you know nothing.
Don't be delusional.

05:30.872 --> 05:32.290
You're all empty inside.

05:33.291 --> 05:34.500
You're just loud.

05:35.543 --> 05:36.544
Like an empty can.

05:36.627 --> 05:40.840
I'm an empty can who won't understand
how you feel until the day I die.

05:44.385 --> 05:45.720
What do you feel now?

05:47.096 --> 05:47.930
Tell me.

05:50.892 --> 05:52.101
Why are you all quiet?

05:52.894 --> 05:54.145
Are you an empty can too?

05:58.900 --> 05:59.901
I...

06:02.278 --> 06:03.112
I...

06:04.113 --> 06:05.073
Just say it.

06:11.037 --> 06:11.871
"I love you."

06:13.623 --> 06:14.749
We'll get a room.

06:18.294 --> 06:19.128
Just...

06:20.088 --> 06:21.756
Any clean and warm room would do.

06:22.173 --> 06:23.174
It's 50,000 won.

06:32.016 --> 06:33.476
What? You have no money?

06:35.603 --> 06:36.687
What about your phone?

06:37.230 --> 06:39.107
Even my mom has to pay on the spot.

06:39.190 --> 06:40.024
Bye.

06:45.363 --> 06:47.281
I guess you ran out in a hurry

06:47.782 --> 06:50.243
that you couldn't think before you acted.

06:54.163 --> 06:54.997
It's okay.

06:55.581 --> 06:57.708
It's natural for men to act instinctively.

06:58.209 --> 06:59.168
Go start your bike.

07:07.885 --> 07:08.719
Hey.

07:11.013 --> 07:14.434
There's a cheap motel down the street.

07:14.851 --> 07:16.811
They let you pay later. Go there.

07:19.188 --> 07:20.189
- Thank you.
- Sure.

07:27.613 --> 07:31.742
CHAPTER 5
RAPUNZEL AND THE CURSED CASTLE

07:52.054 --> 07:52.889
Get off.

08:01.856 --> 08:03.649
His taste is so...

08:11.574 --> 08:12.700
Dry yourself first.

08:14.577 --> 08:16.496
Give me your clothes. I hate dinosaurs.

08:20.583 --> 08:21.959
This is fascinating.

08:22.126 --> 08:24.253
You can take care of all your needs here,

08:24.337 --> 08:26.297
eating, sleeping, and relieving yourself?

08:26.589 --> 08:28.341
This reminds me of an animal stall.

08:29.050 --> 08:32.136
Don't you feel like
you're a domesticated animal living here?

08:36.140 --> 08:37.642
What? Was that rude?

08:38.726 --> 08:39.644
Go get changed.

08:41.229 --> 08:43.481
- Where's your brother?
- Downstairs.

08:44.607 --> 08:46.484
- Don't call him over.
- I won't.

08:47.360 --> 08:49.862
- I don't want you around him.
- Are you jealous?

08:50.446 --> 08:52.615
Don't go near my brother, ever.

08:53.032 --> 08:54.784
- Is this a warning?
- Whatever it is.

08:55.868 --> 08:58.621
- Just leave him alone.
- Will he want the same thing?

09:00.581 --> 09:01.999
I should ask him directly.

09:04.835 --> 09:06.337
What? What's the matter?

09:07.672 --> 09:09.131
What's with that gaze?

09:11.050 --> 09:13.386
- What does my face tell you?
- You're handsome.

09:14.136 --> 09:16.472
- No, my facial expression.
- You look obnoxious.

09:16.556 --> 09:19.433
I'm talking about my mood, emotions,
and the state I'm in.

09:19.517 --> 09:20.434
Not interested.

09:24.021 --> 09:27.066
Take a look at their faces
and try to read their emotions.

09:27.316 --> 09:28.818
Learn it, even if you don't care.

09:29.485 --> 09:32.363
If you don't like to feel the emotions,
just memorize them.

09:33.072 --> 09:35.658
Make an effort
unless you want to live alone forever.

09:36.367 --> 09:39.120
- I don't want to. Why should I?
- You should still do it.

09:42.415 --> 09:44.000
I'm not autistic.

09:44.417 --> 09:46.919
- I'm just--
- You're not the zombie kid either.

09:47.587 --> 09:50.006
The kid with no emotions,
but only the desire to eat.

09:50.798 --> 09:53.467
Do you think what he wanted
was to satiate his hunger?

09:55.845 --> 09:57.054
Or someone's warmth?

09:59.307 --> 10:00.808
What do you think the answer is?

10:01.642 --> 10:04.020
Food? Was satisfying his desire
all that mattered?

10:20.202 --> 10:21.037
Warmth.

10:22.913 --> 10:25.875
This is what he truly wanted.
He didn't want to be just fed.

10:27.001 --> 10:29.420
- You wanted to impart that message.
- You're wrong.

10:29.503 --> 10:32.214
- I'm wrong?
- You're wrong. Food was all that mattered.

10:32.673 --> 10:34.425
He's a zombie, so he has no emotions.

10:34.717 --> 10:37.136
He wanted a full belly
even if it was his mom's limbs.

10:37.637 --> 10:39.847
"Warmth"? Bullshit.

10:40.014 --> 10:43.184
That's just the sickening pity
of sentimentalists like yourself.

10:43.476 --> 10:44.644
You got it all wrong.

10:46.604 --> 10:49.940
I'm hungry. Give me something to eat.
Before I chew off your limbs.

11:10.544 --> 11:11.837
Who's pitying whom?

11:22.014 --> 11:24.141
WHEN USING THE SHAMPOO, PUMP THREE TIMES

11:25.726 --> 11:27.103
SANG-TAE

11:30.564 --> 11:33.025
WHEN BRUSHING TEETH,
DON'T GO OVER THREE MINUTES

11:34.902 --> 11:35.945
Hypocrite.

11:42.410 --> 11:45.496
Why... Why does he hate me?

11:45.579 --> 11:46.664
Sang-tae.

11:47.581 --> 11:49.083
Do as I say, please!

12:01.470 --> 12:02.304
Sang-tae.

12:03.639 --> 12:04.640
Are you still mad?

12:09.645 --> 12:11.355
I'm sorry I yelled at you earlier.

12:12.732 --> 12:13.983
I'll never do that again.

12:15.693 --> 12:16.610
Forgive me.

12:23.409 --> 12:24.285
Sang-tae, please.

12:26.620 --> 12:27.663
That must hurt.

12:29.331 --> 12:30.541
You're hurting yourself.

12:32.501 --> 12:34.378
Someone slapped me in the face today.

12:37.506 --> 12:40.718
I was slapped so hard

12:42.011 --> 12:43.637
that my gums bled,

12:44.638 --> 12:47.349
and I can't even hear well.

12:48.851 --> 12:52.605
My face is all swollen,
so I look like Mr. Lumpy now.

12:53.898 --> 12:55.816
- What do I do?
- "Mr. Lumpy"?

13:02.364 --> 13:05.284
Where's Mr. Lumpy? Mr. Lumpy.

13:07.369 --> 13:08.871
My lumps are all gone.

13:10.831 --> 13:12.082
Gosh, I can't believe it.

13:19.965 --> 13:23.469
Lying is bad. It's deception.
The cops will arrest you.

13:23.552 --> 13:26.388
Pinocchio is bad.
The shepherd boy is also bad.

13:26.472 --> 13:28.599
Since you lied to me,
you deserve a scolding.

13:28.682 --> 13:31.644
You need a spanking.
Will you keep doing it knowing it's bad?

13:31.727 --> 13:33.896
Answer me. Why are you all quiet?

13:33.979 --> 13:36.649
It's because you know you are bad.
Does it hurt?

13:45.241 --> 13:47.910
Have you... You haven't eaten yet, right?

13:48.661 --> 13:49.495
Have a seat.

13:51.997 --> 13:53.499
Are you happy you got spanked?

13:53.958 --> 13:55.501
Why do you keep asking for it?

13:55.584 --> 13:57.878
Are you doing this on purpose?

13:57.962 --> 14:00.005
I got what I deserved.

14:00.089 --> 14:01.090
Jeez.

14:01.590 --> 14:04.009
All right. Come and eat.

14:04.343 --> 14:05.177
Come on.

14:06.428 --> 14:07.263
No.

14:08.097 --> 14:09.473
What? What is it?

14:09.557 --> 14:12.434
Well, would you mind...

14:17.773 --> 14:19.775
Are you hiding your wife somewhere here?

14:21.193 --> 14:23.737
- No, it's my landlady who's over 60.
- I could tell.

14:23.821 --> 14:25.239
She must be a seasoned cook.

14:25.656 --> 14:26.490
Just eat.

14:45.801 --> 14:48.262
I want to live with this lady.
She's a great cook.

14:50.139 --> 14:52.391
- What do you eat at home?
- I don't eat.

14:54.768 --> 14:56.896
I don't have a mom
who'd give me her limbs.

14:57.563 --> 14:59.273
At least you have a live-in cook.

15:02.151 --> 15:03.152
Damn it.

15:29.053 --> 15:33.515
OK PSYCHIATRIC HOSPITAL

16:33.575 --> 16:34.827
Why are you standing here?

16:35.035 --> 16:37.496
Didn't you hear that sound just now?

16:38.455 --> 16:39.289
No.

16:41.333 --> 16:42.418
The power is back on.

16:44.586 --> 16:47.339
I heard someone humming a song
from over there.

16:47.423 --> 16:49.591
Oh, that.

16:51.010 --> 16:52.261
What exactly is "that"?

16:53.303 --> 16:54.972
Didn't Ms. Yoo Seon-hae tell you?

16:55.472 --> 16:59.101
Sometime after midnight,
you can hear a ghost humming a song

17:00.102 --> 17:02.771
at the end of the hallway
on the second floor.

17:08.694 --> 17:10.154
I clearly heard it.

17:10.237 --> 17:11.280
What? A ghost?

17:12.698 --> 17:15.868
- She was probably talking nonsense, right?
- Well, I'm not sure.

17:16.744 --> 17:17.995
Ms. Yoo Seon-hae...

17:22.624 --> 17:25.586
has been making a living
communicating with ghosts.

17:26.378 --> 17:27.212
What?

17:31.008 --> 17:32.301
She was a shaman.

17:38.223 --> 17:39.183
Wait up!

17:41.977 --> 17:43.520
I should make some coffee.

17:45.981 --> 17:48.317
I saw nothing special while making rounds.

17:48.400 --> 17:49.318
Okay, thanks.

17:51.153 --> 17:53.113
- Where's--
- He went to wash his face.

17:53.197 --> 17:54.490
You sure?

17:56.784 --> 17:59.661
- Do you want some coffee?
- Sure, thank you.

17:59.745 --> 18:01.288
How are Mr. Ko Dae-hwan's vitals?

18:01.371 --> 18:03.624
His blood pressure is still
on the high side,

18:03.707 --> 18:05.584
and he's having some sleep disorders.

18:08.504 --> 18:10.130
Well, by the way...

18:11.590 --> 18:15.094
- Earlier in the garden...
- Yes?

18:16.637 --> 18:18.639
Why do you think he did that
to his daughter?

18:23.102 --> 18:26.814
Some post-surgical complications
can result in sudden aggressive outbursts.

18:26.897 --> 18:27.731
Here.

18:29.441 --> 18:31.110
What if that wasn't the cause?

18:34.029 --> 18:36.698
Then what? Are you saying
he attacked her to kill her?

18:41.870 --> 18:42.704
No.

18:43.997 --> 18:44.832
To live.

18:46.542 --> 18:49.169
I mean, because he didn't want to die.

18:49.253 --> 18:52.589
If he became aggressive like that
to protect himself...

18:52.673 --> 18:54.174
Die!

18:55.884 --> 18:57.010
Ms. Nam.

18:58.178 --> 18:59.012
Yes?

19:01.098 --> 19:03.559
You said you and Ms. Ko Mun-yeong
know each other.

19:04.184 --> 19:05.018
Shall we

19:06.854 --> 19:08.480
become friends?

19:08.564 --> 19:10.816
But you tried to hide it,

19:10.899 --> 19:13.152
which means you two aren't really
on good terms.

19:14.194 --> 19:16.196
Go away, please!

19:18.323 --> 19:19.158
Then now,

19:19.908 --> 19:21.952
ask yourself this.

19:22.661 --> 19:25.873
Are you emotionally involving yourself
when it comes to those two?

19:26.373 --> 19:29.793
You shouldn't let countertransference
happen. You're a professional.

19:29.877 --> 19:33.130
A THERAPIST'S EMOTIONAL ENTANGLEMENT
WITH A CLIENT

20:02.910 --> 20:04.536
Finish it quick and lie down here.

20:06.788 --> 20:10.042
We must've been a servant
and a mistress in our past lives.

20:10.751 --> 20:13.378
You're working so hard.
You look scrumptious from behind.

20:16.506 --> 20:19.218
I mean, you look stunning,
not "scrumptious."

20:20.302 --> 20:22.221
- My bad.
- Get up.

20:22.554 --> 20:26.141
- I'll give you money for a cab to go home.
- No, I'll sleep here tonight.

20:27.893 --> 20:30.187
- Who says you can sleep here?
- I can do as I want.

20:30.771 --> 20:32.397
- Get up.
- No, I'll sleep here.

20:32.481 --> 20:34.733
- I'll drag you out.
- You brought me here.

20:35.067 --> 20:37.611
I never said you could sleep here.
Come on. Get up.

20:37.694 --> 20:39.696
You clothed me and fed me,
so let me sleep.

20:39.780 --> 20:42.616
- I'm not raising a newborn. Let go.
- Let go, or I'll scream.

20:42.699 --> 20:45.369
- Get out!
- Sang-tae!

20:49.206 --> 20:52.626
Hey, buddy! Let's have dinner together!

20:56.838 --> 20:59.716
Hey, why... Gosh, why did you come out?

20:59.967 --> 21:01.260
- Sorry, Jae-su.
- Jeez.

21:02.344 --> 21:05.055
Hey, why are you covered in sweat?

21:05.138 --> 21:08.308
Oh, my room is very hot.

21:08.642 --> 21:10.769
Gosh, it's so hot. You don't feel hot?

21:11.228 --> 21:13.230
Hey, are you having hot flashes or what?

21:13.563 --> 21:16.483
You're acting so weird today.

21:18.860 --> 21:19.736
What do you mean?

21:21.738 --> 21:25.033
I thought you'd probably be eating
all alone looking sad,

21:25.117 --> 21:26.618
so I came to keep you company.

21:26.702 --> 21:29.538
- Oh, I've already eaten.
- What? Already?

21:30.372 --> 21:32.958
Yes. Your food will get cold.
Go downstairs and eat.

21:33.375 --> 21:36.169
- Go on.
- Hey, something's fishy here.

21:36.253 --> 21:38.630
You even left Sang-tae downstairs.

21:38.714 --> 21:40.048
Because you were with him.

21:40.465 --> 21:42.801
- You prick, what are you up to all alone?
- Hey!

21:44.136 --> 21:45.929
Gosh, Jae-su.

21:49.599 --> 21:51.101
- You're using force?
- No.

21:51.184 --> 21:52.602
- You're pretty strong.
- No.

21:53.520 --> 21:55.397
- You know who I am, right?
- Of course.

21:55.480 --> 21:56.898
- You do, right?
- Yes.

21:56.982 --> 21:58.483
- You'd better watch out.
- Okay.

21:59.818 --> 22:03.030
- I'll be downstairs. Call me if need be.
- All right, will do.

22:15.125 --> 22:15.959
Open up.

22:16.835 --> 22:17.794
Let me in.

22:21.465 --> 22:22.799
Can you let me in?

22:25.385 --> 22:26.970
Sure, if you let me sleep here.

22:30.682 --> 22:33.060
- Open it first. Then--
- Then you'll drag me out.

22:36.021 --> 22:37.856
No, I won't do that.

22:38.482 --> 22:39.316
For real?

22:40.025 --> 22:43.278
Yes, for real. Open the door first.

22:44.780 --> 22:45.697
Okay.

22:51.578 --> 22:52.537
Here, this is open.

22:58.960 --> 23:03.256
We look like Romeo and Juliet,
staring at each other like this.

23:04.758 --> 23:07.260
You're right. The ill-fated mortal enemies

23:08.512 --> 23:10.222
who should've never crossed paths.

23:10.680 --> 23:12.682
No, they were meant to be. It was fate.

23:13.683 --> 23:15.644
Their tragic fate killed both of them.

23:15.811 --> 23:17.396
Do you know why they both died?

23:17.771 --> 23:20.232
Because only Juliet drank
the sleeping potion.

23:20.816 --> 23:23.318
If they drank it together,
they wouldn't have died.

23:23.610 --> 23:26.154
So let's fall asleep together,
side by side.

23:29.408 --> 23:31.326
What the... Your logic makes no sense.

23:31.410 --> 23:33.078
- Let me in.
- I'll sleep here tonight.

23:33.161 --> 23:34.788
- Open the door.
- Sleep beside me.

23:34.955 --> 23:36.289
Open up before I break it.

23:36.373 --> 23:37.791
How about Sang-tae joins us?

23:38.333 --> 23:39.209
Sang-tae!

23:39.292 --> 23:40.460
What? It burst?

23:40.544 --> 23:42.838
Why would the pipe burst out of the blue?

23:43.338 --> 23:44.798
Shall I come up and--

23:44.881 --> 23:46.675
No, no need. Don't come up.

23:46.758 --> 23:47.634
You startled me.

23:48.301 --> 23:51.054
- I guess it's because the pipe is old.
- It's dirty.

23:51.138 --> 23:54.057
- I should call a plumber tomorrow.
- You often get a cold?

23:54.141 --> 23:54.975
All the time.

23:55.058 --> 23:59.771
There's water everywhere.
I should stay up all night to clean.

24:00.897 --> 24:04.651
No, it's okay.
Just take care of Sang-tae for me.

24:05.861 --> 24:07.529
Right. Thanks, Jae-su.

24:09.322 --> 24:10.907
Yes. Today, you're my favorite.

24:19.124 --> 24:19.958
Open the door.

24:20.667 --> 24:21.710
You're a good actor.

24:23.170 --> 24:25.380
Why did you become a caregiver,
not an actor?

24:34.598 --> 24:36.808
Your lies carry a sense of sincerity.

24:38.185 --> 24:39.686
It makes me want to believe them.

24:43.440 --> 24:44.274
My brother...

24:47.777 --> 24:48.653
Sang-tae

24:51.740 --> 24:53.450
is always looking at my face.

24:58.705 --> 24:59.539
My eyes,

25:01.208 --> 25:04.252
the shape of my brows,
the corners of my mouth,

25:05.545 --> 25:08.006
- and every single wrinkle on my face.
- He's angry.

25:09.591 --> 25:10.884
He studies my face

25:12.969 --> 25:14.304
to figure out my mood.

25:16.556 --> 25:18.475
Even when I'm in unbearable pain

25:19.434 --> 25:20.936
and extremely devastated,

25:23.313 --> 25:24.898
my brother believes

25:27.817 --> 25:29.152
that I'm happy

25:32.030 --> 25:33.406
if I force myself to smile.

25:46.336 --> 25:48.338
All I care about is what he thinks.

25:53.385 --> 25:54.803
It's fine even if it's fake.

25:58.265 --> 25:59.349
Putting on a smile

26:03.645 --> 26:04.771
isn't hard to do.

26:07.774 --> 26:10.443
- "You have no common sense.
- You have no common sense.

26:10.527 --> 26:12.487
- Are you jealous?
- Are you jealous?

26:12.904 --> 26:14.197
- What's wrong?
- What's wrong?

26:15.699 --> 26:17.367
- This isn't good.
- This isn't good.

26:17.450 --> 26:20.829
- I know how he is. He's usually nice,
- I know how he is. He's usually nice,

26:20.912 --> 26:23.456
- but loses it when he's mad.
- but loses it when he's mad.

26:23.540 --> 26:26.793
- I have a bad feeling about today."
- I have a bad feeling about today.

26:27.294 --> 26:28.336
You jerk!

26:33.300 --> 26:34.676
Then smile at me.

26:35.677 --> 26:38.388
You said it's not hard to do. Smile.

26:43.977 --> 26:45.228
Just sleep. It's late.

26:46.438 --> 26:48.481
Were you like this even as a boy?

26:53.069 --> 26:54.070
I saw your photo.

26:57.866 --> 27:00.827
Did you put on a fake smile
even when you were little?

27:05.415 --> 27:06.249
I don't know.

27:07.959 --> 27:09.085
I don't remember.

27:09.794 --> 27:11.421
Then what about that woman?

27:12.422 --> 27:14.174
The woman you liked.

27:15.091 --> 27:16.968
You said my eyes reminded you of her.

27:18.928 --> 27:20.472
Do you still think about her?

27:23.725 --> 27:25.644
- Do you miss her?
- No.

27:28.396 --> 27:29.481
I want to forget her.

27:33.401 --> 27:35.236
She must've been a total bitch.

27:35.320 --> 27:36.571
No, quite the contrary.

27:38.782 --> 27:39.616
I was a jerk.

27:42.535 --> 27:43.953
She saved my life,

27:50.335 --> 27:51.378
but I ran.

27:53.713 --> 27:54.589
Like a coward.

27:57.592 --> 27:58.927
And I've been running away

28:00.637 --> 28:01.846
since then.

28:05.642 --> 28:07.477
Then why did you pick me up earlier?

28:08.353 --> 28:11.189
You ran to me instead of running away.

28:12.065 --> 28:13.358
Right, I regret it.

28:16.611 --> 28:17.779
But I have to say,

28:18.905 --> 28:20.323
I was quite smitten.

29:03.241 --> 29:04.200
What is...

29:05.535 --> 29:07.162
Hey, Jeong-tae!

29:07.245 --> 29:09.330
What? What's up? What's this sound?

29:09.664 --> 29:11.750
- Call the nurse. The nurse!
- What?

29:11.833 --> 29:13.501
- Darn it.
- Hurry!

29:14.169 --> 29:15.587
What's wrong? Professor Ko!

29:16.171 --> 29:18.965
What's the matter? Can you hear me?

30:04.552 --> 30:07.806
Gosh, he's so loud.

30:09.265 --> 30:11.518
Jae-su, you're snoring so loudly.

30:12.185 --> 30:14.979
Jae-su, are you that tired?

30:15.563 --> 30:17.774
You're tired
because you're healthy, right?

30:18.399 --> 30:20.527
Are you okay? Gosh, you're too loud.

30:20.610 --> 30:21.569
Way too loud.

30:51.140 --> 30:51.975
Oh, boy.

30:55.979 --> 30:59.315
My dear daughter, you must be exhausted.

30:59.732 --> 31:01.860
Your butt has shrunken to half its size.

31:06.364 --> 31:08.324
- All right.
- I'll take this upstairs.

31:12.537 --> 31:13.371
Goodness.

31:26.134 --> 31:27.343
Hey.

31:29.596 --> 31:30.930
What are you doing here?

31:34.517 --> 31:36.978
I'm obviously here so early
because I slept here.

31:37.645 --> 31:38.479
What about you?

31:39.772 --> 31:42.191
Do you deliver milk as a side job?

31:42.901 --> 31:43.860
No, I live here.

31:44.819 --> 31:45.987
This is my place.

31:49.574 --> 31:50.783
So,

31:51.701 --> 31:55.246
you're the one who suggested
that he should move

31:55.830 --> 31:57.415
into this house?

31:58.791 --> 32:01.377
That's right. I recommended
that he should live here

32:01.628 --> 32:03.338
and also told him about the hospital.

32:04.088 --> 32:05.381
He made the choice though.

32:05.465 --> 32:08.593
It sounds like he returned
to Seongjin City because of you.

32:11.012 --> 32:12.138
Do you like him?

32:13.848 --> 32:15.558
You do. Have you told him?

32:15.808 --> 32:17.644
- It's none of your business.
- I have.

32:21.981 --> 32:22.815
"I love you.

32:24.442 --> 32:25.318
I love you!

32:27.362 --> 32:28.613
I said, I love you!"

32:30.823 --> 32:32.617
Like that. With all my passion.

32:33.660 --> 32:35.745
- Don't lie.
- I really did.

32:36.621 --> 32:40.583
He kept clinging to me
looking like he wanted something from me,

32:41.167 --> 32:43.002
so I gave him what he wanted.

32:46.589 --> 32:47.924
Are you giving alms or what?

32:49.842 --> 32:50.677
You thief.

32:52.095 --> 32:53.721
- What?
- Don't drool over him.

32:54.055 --> 32:55.598
He was always mine.

32:57.517 --> 32:59.560
Is everything you set your eyes on yours?

33:00.311 --> 33:03.898
If you can't make it yours,
you'd even destroy it to possess it.

33:04.524 --> 33:07.318
Then you'd play with it
and toss it out when you get bored.

33:09.362 --> 33:10.613
You call that "love"?

33:11.072 --> 33:12.615
That's just obsession

33:13.908 --> 33:14.742
and greed.

33:17.787 --> 33:18.621
Two-faced bitch.

33:19.455 --> 33:22.083
You bad-mouth people
but act all coy to their faces.

33:22.750 --> 33:26.045
You always act nice, weak, and innocent.

33:26.838 --> 33:30.466
That's why you never had any friends
in school. Do you get it now?

33:32.343 --> 33:33.219
You crazy...

33:35.013 --> 33:37.181
You evil witch.

33:40.810 --> 33:41.769
Do you want to die?

33:42.520 --> 33:45.606
- Gosh, go to hell!
- Hey, are you on something?

33:45.690 --> 33:47.942
- What the… You need to be on something!
- You…

33:48.026 --> 33:49.944
- Hey, let go!
- You!

33:50.028 --> 33:50.862
Are you high?

33:50.945 --> 33:52.447
- Hey!
- Why you little...

33:53.322 --> 33:55.700
- This is why you'll always fail.
- Damn you!

33:55.783 --> 33:57.744
- Have you lost your mind?
- Ko Mun-yeong!

34:03.374 --> 34:04.375
Let her go.

34:07.628 --> 34:08.504
Let go.

34:10.631 --> 34:13.009
- What's going on?
- What's all this noise?

34:13.092 --> 34:14.385
- What's happening?
- What?

34:31.110 --> 34:33.780
Wait, that bitch hit me first!

34:34.947 --> 34:35.782
Enough.

34:37.158 --> 34:40.787
What? Why am I getting crap for this?
That bitch hit me first.

34:41.537 --> 34:43.206
I don't care who started it.

34:43.372 --> 34:45.583
- Then why are you taking her side?
- "Her side?"

34:45.917 --> 34:46.834
"Ko Mun-yeong!"

34:47.418 --> 34:49.087
You only shouted my name earlier.

34:50.922 --> 34:52.673
Don't be so childish. Just go home.

34:55.176 --> 34:57.804
Come with me.
You need to move out of this shabby house.

34:57.887 --> 35:00.056
- You can't stay here.
- Mind your own business.

35:00.139 --> 35:02.517
I decide where I live. And one more thing.

35:05.353 --> 35:06.395
You don't own me.

35:09.524 --> 35:10.650
How much did you hear?

35:17.323 --> 35:18.241
"I love you.

35:20.368 --> 35:22.328
I said I love you." From that point on.

35:27.125 --> 35:27.959
Here.

35:28.417 --> 35:31.295
I'm paying you back with money
for the love you showed me.

35:52.066 --> 35:52.900
Damn it.

35:54.610 --> 35:55.903
That two-faced bitch.

36:12.503 --> 36:14.046
Sang-tae, wait! Sang-tae!

36:14.714 --> 36:16.632
Sang-tae.

36:21.846 --> 36:22.847
Sang-tae, I...

36:27.059 --> 36:31.647
The pipes are fine. Nothing burst.
Everything works fine.

36:31.981 --> 36:35.401
Nothing burst. Everything's working fine.

36:36.611 --> 36:39.197
Nothing burst.

36:40.031 --> 36:41.991
Nothing burst...

36:42.825 --> 36:43.659
Sang-tae.

36:44.619 --> 36:45.661
I'm sorry.

36:47.038 --> 36:47.997
I lied.

36:48.206 --> 36:51.459
Lying is bad. If you lie,
the cops will come and get you.

36:51.542 --> 36:53.461
You promised me you'd never lie again.

36:55.880 --> 36:59.091
I'm sorry. I promise I'll never lie again.

36:59.967 --> 37:01.302
Forgive me just this once.

37:04.931 --> 37:06.098
Ms. Ko Mun-yeong...

37:07.725 --> 37:09.977
Why was she wearing those clothes?

37:11.562 --> 37:13.272
- What?
- The denim shirt and T-shirt.

37:13.356 --> 37:15.274
"It goes with anything."
You got it on sale

37:15.358 --> 37:17.777
at Bomul Mart.
It was 9,900 won, the BOGO deal.

37:17.860 --> 37:20.863
They're yours.
I know they're your clothes.

37:23.491 --> 37:26.202
I let her borrow them.
It rained last night, you know.

37:26.911 --> 37:29.330
Her clothes got soaked,
so I let her borrow mine.

37:30.331 --> 37:32.291
- What about my clothes?
- What?

37:34.794 --> 37:38.965
I also have nice...
I have a lot of nice clothes too.

37:41.467 --> 37:45.137
I'll let her borrow yours next time
she comes over. The one with dinosaurs.

37:45.221 --> 37:47.431
The one with the ultrasaurus.
It was 27,000 won.

37:47.515 --> 37:50.101
That's more expensive than 9,900 won.

37:50.184 --> 37:52.687
Although higher prices
don't always mean better quality.

37:53.938 --> 37:55.940
Okay, I'll make sure she wears that one.

37:56.899 --> 37:57.733
I promise.

38:01.195 --> 38:02.029
Okay?

38:03.531 --> 38:04.365
Come on.

38:11.914 --> 38:13.249
Get up and have some food.

38:18.629 --> 38:22.133
You need energy
to cry as much as you want.

38:25.094 --> 38:25.928
Get up!

38:26.637 --> 38:28.097
I don't want to eat anything.

38:31.267 --> 38:32.435
She's that girl, right?

38:33.060 --> 38:36.147
The friend you brought
back when I used to run that diner.

38:36.439 --> 38:37.898
She was never my "friend."

38:41.110 --> 38:42.945
Did she pull out a lot of your hair?

38:44.363 --> 38:45.448
Did you lose?

38:45.823 --> 38:47.450
Is that why you're crying?

38:51.871 --> 38:54.206
Ko Mun-yeong...

38:54.623 --> 38:56.500
He shouted only her name.

38:57.168 --> 39:00.546
He glared at her
without even glancing at me.

39:02.798 --> 39:05.176
He always talks so politely to me,

39:05.259 --> 39:07.011
but he talked very casually to her.

39:07.803 --> 39:10.931
You're crying your eyes out
because of that?

39:11.015 --> 39:13.809
He's closer to me.

39:13.893 --> 39:17.104
Why does he call me "Ju-ri" so politely
and why is she…

39:17.188 --> 39:19.440
Why does he call her
"Ko Mun-yeong" like that?

39:20.775 --> 39:26.238
And those clothes too.
We bought them together at a BOGO sale.

39:26.614 --> 39:29.825
I can't believe he let her wear them.

39:30.409 --> 39:32.286
And she slept in his room...

39:32.703 --> 39:36.791
How could he let her sleep in his room?

39:40.002 --> 39:43.422
Well, he said
there was a bit of a situation.

39:43.756 --> 39:46.300
You know that he'd never fool around
with a girl

39:46.384 --> 39:48.344
in his room behind his brother's back.

39:49.011 --> 39:51.972
Don't you worry.
You'll definitely get your chance.

39:56.018 --> 39:58.104
Mom, how did you know?

39:58.270 --> 40:00.898
What? The fact
that you have a crush on Gang-tae?

40:01.232 --> 40:03.567
Everyone in this neighborhood knows.
Here, eat.

40:07.279 --> 40:08.823
Why keep it all inside?

40:09.240 --> 40:11.575
Since this happened,
you should just tell him.

40:12.326 --> 40:14.203
- What if he rejects me?
- Just keep at it.

40:14.286 --> 40:16.497
What if he runs away?

40:16.956 --> 40:18.374
Chase him to the end.

40:19.625 --> 40:22.920
I, too, had to make such efforts
to bring you into this world.

40:27.675 --> 40:28.509
Here.

40:30.177 --> 40:33.139
But I must say, Mun-yeong has grown
into such a pretty lady.

40:33.222 --> 40:36.100
Pretty, my ass!

40:36.183 --> 40:37.643
She is not pretty.

40:38.227 --> 40:40.688
NEW SEONGJIN PUBLIC BATH

40:41.188 --> 40:43.774
Hey, will you please pick up your phone?

40:45.234 --> 40:46.068
Goodness.

40:53.576 --> 40:55.703
- Hello?
- Mr. Lee.

40:56.328 --> 40:58.289
- We're in trouble.
- I told you.

40:58.372 --> 41:01.625
Nothing's important to me
unless it's a life or death situation.

41:02.251 --> 41:04.086
We're all about to die.

41:05.045 --> 41:05.880
What?

41:05.963 --> 41:07.423
When you read someone's book,

41:07.756 --> 41:11.051
you can easily see
how that writer thinks and feels.

41:12.386 --> 41:16.307
Then I guess you also know
what I'm going to do next.

41:17.725 --> 41:20.269
But I, too, can attack you
with the tip of my pen.

41:20.352 --> 41:21.187
Goodbye.

41:29.361 --> 41:32.364
He got surgery for brain hemorrhage
and woke up in two days.

41:32.448 --> 41:34.742
No wonder he has been so quiet lately.

41:35.284 --> 41:36.785
Sir, take a look at this.

41:37.077 --> 41:39.955
He's demanding a huge amount
of compensation.

41:40.331 --> 41:41.332
If we don't comply,

41:41.415 --> 41:44.084
Ms. Ko will be arrested
or end up destroying her career.

41:44.502 --> 41:45.920
What should we do?

41:47.213 --> 41:49.298
Check how much cash we have...

41:49.381 --> 41:52.718
No, never mind.
Tell the accounting manager to join us.

41:54.053 --> 41:56.305
The manager quit a while ago
and can't be reached.

41:56.388 --> 41:58.766
Why didn't you tell me that earlier?

41:59.475 --> 42:00.893
You never asked.

42:02.353 --> 42:05.231
Sir, the printing house
and the distribution warehouse

42:05.314 --> 42:07.525
keep calling us
asking for the overdue payment.

42:07.608 --> 42:10.736
- How did things go at Seongjin City?
- Is she working on her next book?

42:10.819 --> 42:12.613
We're going to be okay, right?

42:14.698 --> 42:16.534
- Mr. Lee!
- Mr. Lee!

42:16.617 --> 42:17.868
- Sir, wake up!
- Mr. Lee!

42:17.952 --> 42:19.119
- Mr. Lee!
- Mr. Lee!

42:19.203 --> 42:21.247
- My gosh. Mr. Lee!
- Sir.

42:21.330 --> 42:22.331
Mr. Lee.

42:30.839 --> 42:33.425
- Are you okay, sir?
- Be quiet for a second. Hold on.

42:33.717 --> 42:34.593
Give me a minute.

42:58.075 --> 42:59.410
Gosh, no way.

43:04.331 --> 43:05.165
Seung-jae.

43:07.960 --> 43:08.961
Yes?

43:09.670 --> 43:11.171
Do you hike?

43:11.714 --> 43:12.631
Yes.

43:13.173 --> 43:15.467
I used to be the leader of a hiking club.

43:31.358 --> 43:32.568
Did you sleep with her?

43:35.321 --> 43:36.322
Are you guys dating?

43:40.701 --> 43:42.036
Do you like that lunatic?

43:46.332 --> 43:47.374
Are you drunk already?

43:49.710 --> 43:52.129
Then why did you ride Alberto
in the rain for her?

43:52.212 --> 43:54.673
Why did you bring her home
when you don't like her?

43:54.757 --> 43:58.344
Why feed her and let her sleep over?
Was it for charity? A new religion?

44:02.014 --> 44:03.349
The beer is a bit bland.

44:05.643 --> 44:06.602
Gang-tae,

44:07.061 --> 44:08.854
don't act out of the ordinary.

44:09.188 --> 44:13.400
- You'll die in the prism of your life.
- It's prime, not "prism."

44:18.155 --> 44:20.157
Anyway, you should be careful.

44:20.240 --> 44:21.408
Did you forget already?

44:21.742 --> 44:25.621
She hurt you with a knife
the first time you met her.

44:42.262 --> 44:43.097
Yes, she did.

44:45.057 --> 44:48.143
My gosh, are you reminiscing?
Is it taking you back and all?

44:50.437 --> 44:51.939
- What are you talking about?
- Hey.

44:52.022 --> 44:54.817
People who are insane
don't act based on logic.

44:54.900 --> 44:57.152
They turn into monsters
the moment they lose it.

44:57.236 --> 45:00.572
Look. Let this scar be a reminder.

45:00.656 --> 45:02.825
Next time, it might not be your hand.
Gosh…

45:03.826 --> 45:06.912
She might just go for your neck.

45:12.876 --> 45:13.711
You're right.

45:15.337 --> 45:16.672
I should avoid her, right?

45:16.755 --> 45:18.590
Of course. Don't ever get involved.

45:21.135 --> 45:23.011
I should stay out of her sight.

45:23.637 --> 45:26.473
Exactly. Don't even go near her.

45:32.020 --> 45:33.063
But the thing is,

45:41.613 --> 45:43.240
I am growing forgetful these days.

45:44.324 --> 45:46.034
- Forgetful about what?
- Everything.

45:49.246 --> 45:50.164
My scars.

45:51.957 --> 45:52.916
The butterflies.

45:56.670 --> 45:57.838
Even Sang-tae.

46:03.927 --> 46:05.637
I sometimes forget about them all.

46:10.392 --> 46:11.351
So

46:13.562 --> 46:15.063
you should remind me like this

46:17.107 --> 46:18.025
from time to time

46:20.569 --> 46:22.070
and help me come to my senses.

46:26.074 --> 46:26.992
Okay.

46:30.329 --> 46:32.039
I get it. So stop smiling like that.

46:35.292 --> 46:36.293
Why?

46:37.503 --> 46:39.087
- Do I look like Joker?
- No.

46:41.882 --> 46:43.008
You look like Chucky.

47:14.289 --> 47:17.167
I'm paying you back with money
for the love you showed me.

47:18.043 --> 47:19.419
It'll be enough for a ride.

47:23.257 --> 47:24.258
Damn it.

47:27.886 --> 47:31.265
Did he give me that to get rid of me?
Am I only worth 30,000 won?

47:32.391 --> 47:33.809
He lives like a poor beggar.

47:35.269 --> 47:37.563
That cheap jerk! How dare he?

47:38.230 --> 47:39.273
Darn it.

47:39.857 --> 47:40.899
Cheap jerk!

47:45.487 --> 47:46.321
That cheap jerk.

47:53.078 --> 47:53.912
Cheap jerk.

48:12.973 --> 48:13.974
My gosh.

48:15.392 --> 48:18.979
Why is he so fickle? It confuses me.
Does he have a split personality?

48:48.175 --> 48:50.385
Sang-tae, are you sleeping?

49:00.187 --> 49:03.357
Sang-tae, who do you like more?
Me or Ko Mun-yeong?

49:11.198 --> 49:13.116
I like you more.

49:16.703 --> 49:18.538
You're my everything.

49:43.772 --> 49:44.690
Who is it?

49:51.446 --> 49:52.280
Mun-yeong.

49:54.866 --> 49:55.826
We're doomed.

49:58.662 --> 49:59.538
Why is she here?

50:03.208 --> 50:04.042
I'm here

50:06.003 --> 50:08.171
because Mr. Lee tricked me
into coming here.

50:12.134 --> 50:13.844
With our company building deposit,

50:14.052 --> 50:16.930
I paid that darn Suicide Bomber
the money he asked for,

50:17.014 --> 50:19.349
gave our team the overdue salary
and severance pay,

50:19.433 --> 50:21.560
and paid all our subcontractors.

50:21.643 --> 50:24.563
- And now, I'm broke.
- You didn't give me my severance pay.

50:25.814 --> 50:28.775
You bought me this suitcase
and asked me to go on a business trip.

50:28.859 --> 50:30.402
- Are you a con artist?
- Hey!

50:30.736 --> 50:33.363
I brought you here
to take responsibility for your future.

50:33.447 --> 50:35.615
How will you do that
when you've gone bankrupt?

50:35.782 --> 50:38.076
Hey, I haven't gone bankrupt.

50:38.535 --> 50:41.580
I still have Ko Mun-yeong. She's my hope.

50:41.663 --> 50:42.581
Right?

50:42.914 --> 50:44.708
- Get out.
- This is so annoying.

50:45.917 --> 50:48.086
- Mun-yeong.
- Why do I have to save you

50:48.170 --> 50:49.421
from this mess you're in?

50:49.504 --> 50:52.257
Hey, come on.
Don't you know who caused this--

50:52.340 --> 50:53.675
You caused this to happen.

50:55.927 --> 50:57.262
Yes, that's right.

50:57.596 --> 50:59.514
It's all because I was an incompetent.

51:00.098 --> 51:01.892
- It's all my fault.
- Incompetent jerk.

51:01.975 --> 51:03.268
Now, leave.

51:04.102 --> 51:05.687
Mun-yeong, don't be like this.

51:05.771 --> 51:09.066
Just let me stay by your side
and help you publish your books.

51:09.149 --> 51:12.027
You even asked me to live with you.
Don't you remember?

51:12.527 --> 51:14.154
Didn't you run away?

51:15.322 --> 51:16.823
Someone else will move in here.

51:18.950 --> 51:19.785
Who?

51:21.578 --> 51:22.496
No way.

52:11.211 --> 52:15.298
OK PSYCHIATRIC HOSPITAL

52:18.844 --> 52:19.678
Young man.

52:20.512 --> 52:21.930
Hey, young man.

52:31.773 --> 52:32.607
Thank you.

52:42.993 --> 52:47.581
I've had my eyes on you
for the past couple of days.

52:49.833 --> 52:51.751
And I noticed that you're very handsome.

52:53.503 --> 52:56.214
You also have a nice build
and seem very reliable.

53:00.260 --> 53:01.303
EMPLOYEE CARD

53:01.386 --> 53:02.846
"Moon Gang-tae"?

53:03.930 --> 53:05.432
You also have a great name.

53:09.144 --> 53:09.978
How old are you?

53:10.937 --> 53:11.813
I'm 30 years old.

53:13.440 --> 53:14.649
What do your parents do?

53:17.485 --> 53:18.320
They're dead.

53:19.279 --> 53:20.322
Both of them?

53:22.407 --> 53:23.241
Oh, dear.

53:26.745 --> 53:28.079
Do you have a girlfriend?

53:31.833 --> 53:32.834
No.

53:35.086 --> 53:37.756
So that nurse has a crush on you?

53:38.757 --> 53:39.758
Pardon?

53:41.760 --> 53:42.594
That's good.

53:43.553 --> 53:44.679
What do you mean?

53:46.890 --> 53:50.727
I'd like to introduce you to a nice lady
who would be perfect for you.

53:52.604 --> 53:53.980
No, it's okay.

53:54.064 --> 53:55.774
It's not because she's my daughter.

53:56.608 --> 53:59.194
She really is a great catch.

54:00.237 --> 54:03.031
You should meet her
when she visits me one day.

54:03.323 --> 54:05.533
Well, I'll think about it.

54:06.243 --> 54:08.078
I need to get back to work.

54:09.746 --> 54:12.666
Let me know if you have a change of heart.

54:17.671 --> 54:20.006
They'll be a really good match.

54:31.935 --> 54:32.978
This isn't it.

54:36.481 --> 54:38.024
No.

54:43.238 --> 54:44.155
This isn't it.

54:55.166 --> 54:56.960
How about green?

55:01.923 --> 55:03.675
Gosh, no.

55:04.759 --> 55:05.593
This one?

55:07.220 --> 55:08.054
My goodness.

55:09.014 --> 55:12.809
The first step is always the hardest.

55:13.184 --> 55:16.396
But once you take your first step,
things will get easier from then on.

55:20.692 --> 55:25.071
Now, it's time for you to show me
what you're capable of.

55:26.823 --> 55:28.783
No, no! This isn't right!

55:28.867 --> 55:30.452
No!

55:30.535 --> 55:32.871
- I'm sorry.
- Why did you do that? That was bad.

55:32.954 --> 55:34.581
- Come here.
- I won't do it again.

55:34.664 --> 55:36.750
- Sang-tae.
- You can't do that.

55:36.833 --> 55:39.002
The director isn't sane either.
Don't you agree?

55:40.628 --> 55:43.673
Why are you crying again?
You promised you wouldn't cry.

55:43.757 --> 55:44.841
You ruined it.

55:44.924 --> 55:47.344
- A-reum.
- Because I'm jealous.

55:47.427 --> 55:49.554
I also want to play tag like that.

55:50.472 --> 55:53.767
Hold my hand. Let's go take your medicine.

55:54.100 --> 55:55.852
- You need to get scolded!
- No!

55:55.935 --> 55:57.645
Do you want to get scolded?

55:59.773 --> 56:00.607
It's funny

56:00.690 --> 56:03.818
how people who should be wearing
a patient gown aren't wearing one.

56:03.902 --> 56:06.738
- Why did you do that? Why?
- My goodness.

56:06.821 --> 56:08.198
Do you want to get scolded?

56:18.416 --> 56:19.334
Ms. Ko.

56:20.627 --> 56:21.503
How do you feel?

56:21.586 --> 56:23.380
Never good. Why did you call me?

56:26.674 --> 56:29.677
I heard what your father did to you.
I'm very sorry.

56:31.221 --> 56:32.764
It wasn't you who strangled me.

56:32.847 --> 56:35.725
But still, I was the one who told you
to take him out for walks.

56:35.809 --> 56:38.645
Then it was a medical accident.
You can't just end it

56:38.728 --> 56:40.313
with an apology.

56:44.025 --> 56:45.193
Then let's do this.

56:46.653 --> 56:49.030
You can strangle me instead.
Here. Go ahead.

56:51.658 --> 56:53.952
What a crazy old man.

56:57.664 --> 56:59.457
The sound of a ghost humming?

57:00.583 --> 57:01.418
Yes.

57:01.793 --> 57:05.839
By any chance, do you know what time
it was when you heard that last night?

57:08.174 --> 57:09.008
I don't know.

57:09.634 --> 57:11.761
I don't even know what date it is today.

57:12.220 --> 57:14.389
I just heard it on my way to the bathroom.

57:17.559 --> 57:20.812
Then did you happen to see anyone
in front of room 203

57:20.895 --> 57:23.106
or in the hallway?

57:24.858 --> 57:27.986
She said it was a ghost humming,
so it was probably a ghost.

57:30.780 --> 57:32.157
Ms. Nam.

57:33.408 --> 57:36.786
- Do you believe her gibberish?
- It's not gibberish.

57:37.704 --> 57:39.539
I swear I can hear it.

57:39.622 --> 57:43.835
That's called auditory hallucination.
And it's proof that you're crazy.

57:46.004 --> 57:48.506
Hey, I'm not crazy.

57:48.965 --> 57:51.009
Yes, I'm sure you heard what you heard.

57:56.473 --> 57:59.017
Then are you saying I'm crazy?

58:31.424 --> 58:33.051
Standing here with you like this

58:34.427 --> 58:35.678
reminds me of the past.

58:38.515 --> 58:40.350
Do you remember what you said to me,

58:40.767 --> 58:43.603
crying on the rooftop
after getting slapped by a patient?

58:44.729 --> 58:46.147
back at Yongrim Hospital?

58:47.232 --> 58:50.568
"Why don't you slap me
and make yourself feel better?"

58:55.031 --> 58:56.699
I didn't know you'd really slap me.

58:56.783 --> 58:58.868
I must've been crazy. Why did I do that?

59:03.831 --> 59:07.585
But thanks to that,
we became really close, didn't we?

59:13.466 --> 59:14.300
Or are we not?

59:16.844 --> 59:18.096
Are we not close?

59:20.807 --> 59:21.766
Ju-ri.

59:27.897 --> 59:29.440
Do you want to slap me again?

59:32.068 --> 59:32.902
Why?

59:33.653 --> 59:37.240
Because I feel like you'll get upset
in a little while.

59:46.416 --> 59:47.250
Are you

59:48.960 --> 59:50.503
rejecting me already?

59:51.129 --> 59:52.255
Don't bother

59:54.173 --> 59:55.592
wasting your emotions on me.

59:57.343 --> 59:58.761
I don't deserve any of that.

59:59.554 --> 01:00:00.805
Because

01:00:02.473 --> 01:00:04.017
you're going to leave anyway?

01:00:07.061 --> 01:00:09.147
It doesn't matter. Just...

01:00:11.065 --> 01:00:14.277
Just let me keep liking you.
That's up to me.

01:00:22.493 --> 01:00:23.911
Do me a favor.

01:00:29.250 --> 01:00:30.209
I hope

01:00:33.630 --> 01:00:35.465
you don't run away

01:00:37.592 --> 01:00:40.678
because you find me uncomfortable.

01:00:41.638 --> 01:00:42.472
If you do,

01:00:43.681 --> 01:00:47.602
it'll make me feel really pathetic

01:00:53.941 --> 01:00:55.234
and sad.

01:00:58.029 --> 01:01:00.657
Just continue to live with us at our house

01:01:02.325 --> 01:01:03.826
while you're in Seongjin City.

01:01:08.581 --> 01:01:11.250
My mom really likes you guys.

01:01:11.334 --> 01:01:12.168
And...

01:01:14.629 --> 01:01:17.715
Sang-tae likes living with us as well.

01:01:23.346 --> 01:01:24.514
Please do that for me.

01:01:50.873 --> 01:01:53.918
O Ji-wang is bad. O Ji-wang.

01:01:54.669 --> 01:01:56.295
O Ji-wang...

01:01:56.379 --> 01:01:58.923
O Ji-wang is a bad person.

01:02:01.050 --> 01:02:03.553
He may be a doctor, but he's a bad person.

01:02:03.636 --> 01:02:07.056
O Ji-wang is really fast. He's bad.

01:02:07.140 --> 01:02:10.101
He needs to learn his manners.
Koreans should be courteous.

01:02:14.522 --> 01:02:15.356
Sang-tae.

01:02:19.026 --> 01:02:20.945
- Do you want to have fun with me?
- Yes.

01:02:28.077 --> 01:02:30.371
FACILITY MANAGEMENT CHECKLIST

01:02:33.791 --> 01:02:37.211
The number you have dialed is unavailable.
Please leave a voicemail--

01:02:44.802 --> 01:02:47.472
How much did you pay for this car?

01:02:47.555 --> 01:02:49.974
Is it more than one million won?
Two million won?

01:02:50.141 --> 01:02:51.934
It costs 100 to 1,000 times more.

01:02:52.727 --> 01:02:55.480
How much money do you have?
Are you rich?

01:02:55.897 --> 01:02:57.732
I'm 100 to 1,000 times richer than you.

01:03:00.109 --> 01:03:01.486
I guess you like money.

01:03:01.569 --> 01:03:04.906
Yes, I like money, cars,
and I like you, too.

01:03:04.989 --> 01:03:06.866
I like you 100 to 12,000 times more.

01:03:08.659 --> 01:03:11.662
But where are we going? It's dark outside.

01:03:17.001 --> 01:03:18.252
Where did he go?

01:03:19.837 --> 01:03:20.755
I'm on duty again.

01:03:22.048 --> 01:03:24.050
Are you looking for your brother?

01:03:24.133 --> 01:03:25.134
Have you seen him?

01:03:25.843 --> 01:03:28.721
He left earlier with Ms. Ko.

01:03:29.722 --> 01:03:31.682
Why was she here?
She had no class today.

01:03:32.266 --> 01:03:33.184
I don't know.

01:03:42.443 --> 01:03:43.820
Is it okay

01:03:45.112 --> 01:03:47.031
if I touch you?

01:03:58.501 --> 01:04:00.419
Oh my gosh.

01:04:10.263 --> 01:04:12.014
- Do you like it?
- Yes.

01:04:12.306 --> 01:04:14.433
- Do you like this place?
- Yes.

01:04:15.434 --> 01:04:17.562
- Would you like to move in with me?
- Yes.

01:04:19.188 --> 01:04:21.023
- Then sign this.
- Okay.

01:04:23.776 --> 01:04:25.862
ILLUSTRATION CONTRACT

01:05:24.337 --> 01:05:25.338
Where is my brother?

01:05:26.672 --> 01:05:27.715
He's with me.

01:05:29.133 --> 01:05:29.967
I warned you

01:05:31.886 --> 01:05:33.512
to stay away from my brother.

01:05:34.180 --> 01:05:37.642
The employee will live...

01:05:37.892 --> 01:05:41.729
The employee will live in...

01:05:41.812 --> 01:05:44.106
- I was bored, so we hung out.
- the employer's...

01:05:44.190 --> 01:05:45.358
Why not come pick him up?

01:05:48.527 --> 01:05:49.362
Where are you?

01:05:51.322 --> 01:05:52.698
We're at the cursed castle.

01:05:53.908 --> 01:05:54.742
Okay.

01:05:55.660 --> 01:05:57.161
Do you even know where it is?

01:05:58.537 --> 01:05:59.372
Yes, I know.

01:06:04.418 --> 01:06:05.586
How?

01:06:06.128 --> 01:06:08.005
- Because I've been there.
- What?

01:06:11.801 --> 01:06:13.177
That day when you saved me,

01:06:14.512 --> 01:06:17.431
and I ran away from you.

01:06:19.600 --> 01:06:20.518
Are you telling me

01:06:23.646 --> 01:06:24.730
that you knew?

01:06:27.566 --> 01:06:28.567
I'll see you soon.

01:07:09.150 --> 01:07:09.984
Sang-tae.

01:07:11.694 --> 01:07:13.779
Should I tell you an old tale?

01:07:15.489 --> 01:07:16.365
Yes.

01:07:18.034 --> 01:07:20.494
A long time ago, deep inside the forest,

01:07:21.370 --> 01:07:22.872
there lived a little girl

01:07:24.081 --> 01:07:25.791
in a cursed castle.

01:07:28.586 --> 01:07:32.214
The little girl's mother
always told her daughter

01:07:34.300 --> 01:07:36.135
that she's too special

01:07:37.386 --> 01:07:40.431
to live among everyone else
outside the castle.

01:07:42.975 --> 01:07:44.018
The mother told her

01:07:45.853 --> 01:07:47.980
that she must only live inside the castle.

01:07:53.944 --> 01:07:55.488
However, the little girl

01:07:56.697 --> 01:07:58.532
felt like she was imprisoned.

01:08:01.577 --> 01:08:03.913
So she prayed to the moon every day.

01:08:06.999 --> 01:08:07.917
"Please

01:08:09.460 --> 01:08:14.006
send me a handsome prince
who can save me from here."

01:08:19.303 --> 01:08:20.679
"Will he come today?

01:08:22.598 --> 01:08:24.266
Will he come tomorrow?"

01:08:25.810 --> 01:08:26.727
The little girl

01:08:28.437 --> 01:08:30.481
waited every day
for her prince to show up.

01:09:32.001 --> 01:09:33.419
Earlier, I was too--

01:09:37.756 --> 01:09:38.591
Get lost.

01:11:25.364 --> 01:11:28.367
SPECIAL THANKS TO JUNG SANG-HOON
FOR MAKING A GUEST APPEARANCE

01:12:01.150 --> 01:12:02.192
Let's live together.

01:12:02.276 --> 01:12:04.069
This is our home now.

01:12:04.153 --> 01:12:05.321
This is not our home!

01:12:05.404 --> 01:12:08.490
It's mine! No! That's mine!

01:12:08.574 --> 01:12:09.700
Gang-tae.

01:12:10.576 --> 01:12:12.411
You took good care of him until now.

01:12:12.995 --> 01:12:15.539
Now, it's time for you
to let him do what he wants.

01:12:16.165 --> 01:12:18.334
No, I'm against this team!

01:12:19.168 --> 01:12:22.463
You cause trouble
because you can't even control yourself.

01:12:22.546 --> 01:12:24.340
So how are you going to care for him?

01:12:24.423 --> 01:12:27.551
Sang-tae. Have you ever
heard the story of Bluebeard?

01:12:31.555 --> 01:12:33.557
Subtitle translation by Ja-won Lee
